SUMMARY:GitHub Agentic Workflows: Automation That Actually Reads the Room
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nGitHub Agentic Workflows let your r
 epo improve itself. With a simple markdown file and one command\, GitHub A
 ctions launches an AI agent to triage issues\, fix CI failures\, update do
 cs\, and improve tests—no complex YAML required.\n\nSee a live demo from
  minimal workflow file to a safe\, sandboxed pipeline that delivers a read
 y‑to‑review PR. Your repo on autopilot\, with you in control.\n\n📍 
 This session is a part of a series. To learn more\, and register for resou
 rces to be delivered directly to your inbox\, [click here](https://develop
 er.microsoft.com/reactor/series/S-1659/?wt.mc_id=meetup_26943_webpage_reac
 tor)
