SUMMARY:Agent Orchestration: Directing Your AI Dream Team
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nWhat is Agent Orchestration? Assign
 ing one primary agent the job of a project manager (orchestrator) whose so
 le purpose is delegating tasks to specialized sub-agents such as a Planner
 \, Coder\, and Designer.\n\n📍 This session is a part of a series. To le
 arn more\, and register for resources to be delivered directly to your inb
 ox\, [click here](https://developer.microsoft.com/reactor/series/S-1659/?w
 t.mc_id=meetup_26943_webpage_reactor)
